<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113223" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰμ-ᾶθεν</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμαί</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from the
				ground,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.172
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				146b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				249
			</span></i>, the Attic form, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				187.7
			</span></i> (who also gives <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμαῖθεν</span>
			which is found in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.296e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμάθεν [ᾰ</span>] is v.l.
				in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.125
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμόθεν</span></b>  is found in <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				296
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.2.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Stesich.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1395a2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, and was the colloquial form acc. to <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				188.33
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
